        "Consumer Unit Upgrades",
        "Replace old fuse boards with modern, RCD-protected consumer units that meet current wiring regulations.",
        "Fault Finding & Repairs",
        "Tripping breakers, flickering lights, dead sockets — we diagnose the root cause and fix it, not just patch it.",
        "EV Charger Installation",
        "OZEV-approved home and workplace EV charge point installations, wired safely into your existing supply.",
        "Lighting & Sockets",
